// Hand-authored Pine v5 fixture — user-defined function with typed args.
// Pine v5 optionally allows type annotations on function parameters
// (e.g. ``f(float x, int n) => ...``); v6 keeps this syntax verbatim.
// The migration shim MUST leave these declarations untouched — a stray
// rewrite would corrupt the type annotations.
//
// Per PRD §2.1: hand-authored, not copied from TradingView.
//
// Covers: study() → indicator(), typed function args (float, int),
// custom function calling ta.sma, plot().
//@version=5
study("Typed Function Args", overlay=true)
weighted(float src, int len) =>
    basis = ta.sma(src, len)
    basis + src / 2
smoothed = weighted(close, 14)
plot(smoothed, title="w", color=color.red)
